   "voucher_note": "Reservation voucher MUST state the quoted room rate (basis) and other necessary information such as supplements",
   "terms_text": "All room rates are inclusive of all taxes and non-commissionable. Contracted rates are confidential and cannot be published online or on any platform other than the company system. Check-in 2.00 pm, check-out 11.00 am; early check-in / late check-out subject to availability, charges apply. No pets. Bookings are confirmed by e-mail, subject to written confirmation from the reservations department followed by a proforma invoice. If overbooked, the hotel may transfer reservations to alternate accommodation of similar rating/category. Guests are responsible for any loss or damage to hotel property. DBI e-mail 24 Aug 2026: rates apply to new reservations only; only HB bookings are accepted on 24 and 31 Dec 2026; reservations / amendments / cancellations to info@dbihotels.lk, reservation@dbihotels.lk, sales3@dbihotels.lk.",
   "child_policy_text": "Below 5.99 years free of charge sharing parent's bed on booked basis. 6 – 11 years 50% of the adult rate on booked basis per night (excluding extra bed). 12 years and above considered as an adult. Extra bed $15 per night. Child meal rate 50% of the adult rate.",
   "cancellation_text": "November – April: release period 21 days prior to arrival; 50% of the full booking value charged if cancelled within 21 days. May – October: release period 14 days prior to arrival; 50% of the full booking value charged if cancelled within 14 days. No-shows: 100% of the full stay / no refund (if payment is settled). An early departure fee applies for cancellations made after check-in.",
   "payment_text": "Full payment to be settled 7 days prior to the date of arrival. Cheque payments must be banked and realised at least 10 days prior to arrival. Reservations made within 7 days of arrival: payment in full upon booking confirmation. Failure to settle in full by the above date: rooms released without prior notice. Hotel reserves the right to release bookings with unsettled payment (excluding credit agents) with advance notice of 14 days or more. Bank: Moi Ella DBI (Pvt) Ltd, Commercial Bank Rajagiriya, A/C 1000636862. Quote travel agency / guest name / confirmation number as reference.",
   "guide_policy_text": "Group bookings with 15 or more paying guests: guide room provided FOC. Guide fee (per night) for less than 15 paying guests: USD 35 BB / USD 45 HB. If the hotel is fully booked, guide accommodation will be provided at a nearby suitable accommodation.",
